# pause-hook-origin reads the five log-seeding hooks (all five are copied and legend-compared,
# pause is also driven), plus what the driven pause hook loads fail-open beside itself: the
# provenance library and the pause-routing schema. A fail-open input is REQUIRED too, because
# dropping it leaves the verdict unchanged; its sentinel in run.sh is presence-guarded.
# SKILL.md is read by assertion 10, which binds its INITIALIZATION resume pair to the
# acknowledge hook's.
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-pause.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-continue.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-acknowledge.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-escalation-delivery.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-answer-capture.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-context-provenance.sh
!core/schemas/pause-routing.json
!core/skills/ai-dlc/SKILL.md
core/fixtures/lib/
